1
00:00:07,120 --> 00:00:08,920
‪SAY NO TO PIRACY, SUPPORT ORIGINALS

2
00:01:35,720 --> 00:01:37,640
‪ADAPTED FROM <i>‪JIA JIN CHAI</i>‪, ORIGINAL NOVEL
‪BY XIAOJIAREN ON JINJIANG LITERATURE CITY

3
00:01:42,000 --> 00:01:45,160
My Lady,
you've only been married a few days,

4
00:01:45,240 --> 00:01:46,680
and your dowry attendant is already dead.

5
00:01:46,760 --> 00:01:50,680
People who don't know the truth
may blame you for her death.

6
00:01:50,760 --> 00:01:52,480
What do we do now?

7
00:01:54,520 --> 00:01:55,600
My Lady.

8
00:01:56,640 --> 00:01:57,640
What brings you here, My Lord?

9
00:01:57,720 --> 00:01:58,920
You could've sent word through me.

10
00:01:59,000 --> 00:02:00,640
There was no need to come yourself.

11
00:02:00,720 --> 00:02:03,040
I remembered something important
I need to tell her myself.

12
00:02:03,120 --> 00:02:04,560
Madam, His Lordship is here.

13
00:02:07,960 --> 00:02:11,320
HERITAGE PRESERVED, GOODNESS PROCLAIMED

14
00:02:14,400 --> 00:02:15,480
Open the door at once.

15
00:02:16,080 --> 00:02:17,160
- No.
- My Lady.

16
00:02:18,440 --> 00:02:19,800
We can't let her die here.

17
00:02:20,880 --> 00:02:22,080
Put her on the bed.

18
00:02:22,160 --> 00:02:23,680
Draw the curtains. Hurry!

19
00:02:32,240 --> 00:02:33,160
My Lord.

20
00:02:34,760 --> 00:02:38,440
My Lord, My Lady took her medicine
and just went to bed.

21
00:02:45,200 --> 00:02:48,080
I need to speak with her. Leave us.

22
00:02:49,560 --> 00:02:50,440
My Lord.

23
00:02:50,520 --> 00:02:52,040
My Lady was in terrible pain last night.

24
00:02:52,120 --> 00:02:53,480
She couldn't sleep all night.

25
00:02:53,560 --> 00:02:54,960
She only just fell asleep.

26
00:02:55,480 --> 00:02:56,560
Move.

27
00:02:57,560 --> 00:02:59,320
My Lord. My Lord!

28
00:03:54,000 --> 00:03:56,400
My Lord, why did you come to see me?

29
00:04:01,120 --> 00:04:04,000
There's something I forgot to tell you.

30
00:04:05,080 --> 00:04:06,080
What is it?

31
00:04:26,120 --> 00:04:28,160
I failed to put the brocade away
properly earlier

32
00:04:28,840 --> 00:04:30,280
and nearly startled you.

33
00:04:30,360 --> 00:04:32,440
Please forgive me, My Lord, My Lady.

34
00:04:38,920 --> 00:04:40,000
Grandmother said

35
00:04:40,840 --> 00:04:43,480
the Wei family gave you many
rare fabrics from the palace

36
00:04:44,120 --> 00:04:45,240
that can't be found anywhere else.

37
00:04:46,760 --> 00:04:47,960
I'd like to see them for myself.

38
00:04:58,400 --> 00:05:01,120
My Lord, the wardrobe was just searched.

39
00:05:01,200 --> 00:05:02,120
It's quite a mess.

40
00:05:02,200 --> 00:05:03,440
My Lord.

41
00:05:04,280 --> 00:05:05,600
My Lord.

42
00:05:07,400 --> 00:05:08,440
Let him look!

43
00:05:14,000 --> 00:05:17,960
I once gave my heart to you, My Lord,
mand foolishly made a mistake.

44
00:05:18,800 --> 00:05:22,400
Since then, you've loathed me
and always guarded against me.

45
00:05:23,040 --> 00:05:26,160
I admired you, My Lord,
as a man who always keeps his word.

46
00:05:27,040 --> 00:05:29,520
I vowed to keep my promise
and change my ways.

47
00:05:30,560 --> 00:05:34,200
But you, My Lord,
still see me as a scheming thief.

48
00:05:35,000 --> 00:05:36,480
Now I don't know what you suspect me of.

49
00:05:37,400 --> 00:05:39,400
You barge into my room in broad daylight,

50
00:05:39,480 --> 00:05:41,480
suspecting me and searching everywhere.

51
00:05:41,560 --> 00:05:42,480
Go ahead. Search all you want!

52
00:05:43,440 --> 00:05:45,840
After all, I'm just someone you despise,
someone who means nothing to you,

53
00:05:47,160 --> 00:05:49,240
not even worthy of your respect.

54
00:05:54,320 --> 00:05:55,360
That's not what I meant.

55
00:05:58,880 --> 00:06:00,080
I was just curious.

56
00:06:00,160 --> 00:06:02,160
I had my maid find the bridal booklet.

57
00:06:02,880 --> 00:06:04,880
She left my undergarments in quite a mess.

58
00:06:05,520 --> 00:06:06,520
I hid it because I feared
it looked improper.

59
00:06:06,600 --> 00:06:07,680
That's why I kept it private.

60
00:06:09,200 --> 00:06:11,000
There's more than
a bridal booklet in there.

61
00:06:12,400 --> 00:06:13,960
There are also intimate wedding charms.

62
00:06:14,960 --> 00:06:18,280
If you want to look,
then take a good look at everything.

63
00:06:18,360 --> 00:06:21,080
If you don't look closely today,
and want another look tomorrow,

64
00:06:21,720 --> 00:06:23,240
I may not even let you through the door!

65
00:06:25,880 --> 00:06:28,920
BLISSFUL UNION

66
00:06:35,160 --> 00:06:36,320
Who knew you would…

67
00:06:38,960 --> 00:06:40,520
A lady should conduct herself properly.

68
00:06:40,600 --> 00:06:42,360
It's broad daylight. Behave yourself.

69
00:06:42,960 --> 00:06:43,880
What if someone saw you?

70
00:06:44,400 --> 00:06:45,400
It would be scandalous.

71
00:06:47,640 --> 00:06:48,800
Fine. I won't look.

72
00:06:51,440 --> 00:06:52,280
Stop!

73
00:06:58,160 --> 00:07:00,360
- You…
- What did you really come here for?

74
00:07:03,080 --> 00:07:05,200
Even when sleeping alone,

75
00:07:05,280 --> 00:07:07,080
you should stay properly
dressed and composed.

76
00:07:07,160 --> 00:07:09,760
I came to tell you
about the Lu family's past,

77
00:07:09,840 --> 00:07:11,200
so you wouldn't
give yourself away in public.

78
00:07:11,800 --> 00:07:13,560
But now isn't a good time.
We'll talk another day.

79
00:07:26,240 --> 00:07:27,240
Well done.

80
00:07:28,200 --> 00:07:30,920
My Lord. Didn't you say
you had something important to discuss?

81
00:07:31,000 --> 00:07:32,640
Why are you leaving
as soon as you arrived?

82
00:07:32,720 --> 00:07:36,120
After making this trip for nothing,
Governess Miao will give me an earful.

83
00:07:38,480 --> 00:07:40,560
BLISSFUL UNION

84
00:07:40,640 --> 00:07:41,680
What kind of coin is this?

85
00:07:41,760 --> 00:07:43,480
How come I've never seen one before?

86
00:07:46,800 --> 00:07:47,760
Aren't you leaving?

87
00:07:49,080 --> 00:07:49,920
I am.

88
00:07:54,560 --> 00:07:56,000
Here, My Lord. Let me give you a hand.

89
00:08:04,120 --> 00:08:06,760
DUKE'S RESIDENCE

90
00:08:15,640 --> 00:08:16,720
You're on duty tonight?

91
00:08:16,800 --> 00:08:17,760
Yes.

92
00:08:18,280 --> 00:08:19,800
Governess Wu hasn't been seen
since this afternoon.

93
00:08:19,880 --> 00:08:21,360
My Lady is angry.

94
00:08:21,440 --> 00:08:23,040
She ordered you to find her at once.

95
00:08:23,120 --> 00:08:23,960
Yes.

96
00:08:27,040 --> 00:08:28,720
Governess Wu often drinks too much

97
00:08:28,800 --> 00:08:30,720
and sleeps it off
somewhere cool in the garden.

98
00:08:31,280 --> 00:08:33,760
Wake every maid and servant
on duty tonight.

99
00:08:33,840 --> 00:08:36,240
Search the rockery, bushes, and pavilions.

100
00:08:36,320 --> 00:08:37,559
Take lanterns and search every corner.

101
00:08:37,640 --> 00:08:38,799
Go quietly.

102
00:08:38,880 --> 00:08:40,559
Don't alert the front courtyard.

103
00:08:40,640 --> 00:08:43,640
If Governess Miao finds out,
someone's bound to be punished.

104
00:08:44,240 --> 00:08:45,280
- Yes.
- Yes.

105
00:08:46,400 --> 00:08:50,320
HERITAGE PRESERVED, GOODNESS PROCLAIMED

106
00:09:01,320 --> 00:09:03,240
My Lady, I've sent them all away.

107
00:09:04,760 --> 00:09:07,680
I've tried again and again to stop you,
but you just won't listen.

108
00:09:08,560 --> 00:09:10,440
If you keep putting your health
at risk like this,

109
00:09:11,040 --> 00:09:12,080
I won't keep it secret anymore.

110
00:09:12,160 --> 00:09:13,600
I'll tell the Dowager Lady
everything myself

111
00:09:13,680 --> 00:09:15,400
and take 40 strokes as punishment.

112
00:09:15,480 --> 00:09:17,680
Anything's better than living
in fear every day.

113
00:09:23,600 --> 00:09:24,560
Let him look!

114
00:09:28,600 --> 00:09:29,760
Something's definitely wrong.

115
00:09:30,480 --> 00:09:31,400
Help me up.

116
00:09:32,960 --> 00:09:34,120
Don't alert anyone.

117
00:09:43,880 --> 00:09:44,920
My Lord.

118
00:09:45,000 --> 00:09:46,920
That looks like Bitao, the lady's maid.

119
00:09:47,000 --> 00:09:49,040
The woods out back are always deserted.

120
00:09:49,120 --> 00:09:50,560
The maids and servants rarely go there.

121
00:09:51,800 --> 00:09:52,640
Follow her.

122
00:10:02,240 --> 00:10:03,320
Did you bring everything?

123
00:10:03,400 --> 00:10:04,400
Yes.

124
00:10:24,920 --> 00:10:25,960
LU ZHUO'S BIRTH DETAILS

125
00:10:26,040 --> 00:10:29,160
Will this really work?

126
00:10:29,240 --> 00:10:30,320
Back in my hometown,

127
00:10:30,400 --> 00:10:32,920
when a marriage is troubled,

128
00:10:33,520 --> 00:10:35,320
all you need is a lock of the wife's hair.

129
00:10:35,400 --> 00:10:37,760
Tie it around
both birth charts and burn them.

130
00:10:37,840 --> 00:10:40,120
It'll bind their fates together for life.

131
00:10:40,200 --> 00:10:42,240
Nothing will ever break that bond.

132
00:10:43,800 --> 00:10:44,680
Rest assured, My Lady.

133
00:10:44,760 --> 00:10:47,120
This ritual never fails.

134
00:10:47,200 --> 00:10:50,520
You and His Lordship
will live in perfect harmony,

135
00:10:50,600 --> 00:10:51,600
loving and devoted to each other.

136
00:11:04,400 --> 00:11:05,960
She's really that devoted to me?

137
00:11:06,840 --> 00:11:08,680
She still hasn't given up.

138
00:11:11,200 --> 00:11:13,400
- Are you coming?
- Coming.

139
00:11:19,640 --> 00:11:21,480
The lady truly loves you deeply.

140
00:11:21,560 --> 00:11:23,640
She's even resorted to some
old folk ritual.

141
00:11:24,560 --> 00:11:26,840
In my humble opinion,
back at the Princess's Residence,

142
00:11:27,360 --> 00:11:29,040
maybe she just lost her head for a moment.

143
00:11:30,240 --> 00:11:34,040
Given how deeply she loves you,
perhaps you could forgive her a little.

144
00:11:34,120 --> 00:11:35,440
Want to lose your tongue?

145
00:11:38,400 --> 00:11:40,160
Does love excuse trying to kill someone?

146
00:11:40,680 --> 00:11:42,800
That kind of love
is twisted and terrifying.

147
00:11:43,320 --> 00:11:44,280
I want no part of it.

148
00:11:49,800 --> 00:11:53,320
Tell Governess Miao tomorrow
to post more guards at night,

149
00:11:53,880 --> 00:11:54,880
so she doesn't wander around

150
00:11:56,440 --> 00:11:57,760
and catch a chill.

151
00:11:58,360 --> 00:11:59,520
Then she'll blame the Lu family
for mistreating her.

152
00:12:00,400 --> 00:12:01,280
Yes.

153
00:12:19,320 --> 00:12:20,920
My Lady, they're gone.

154
00:12:21,440 --> 00:12:23,080
How did you know His Lordship would come?

155
00:12:23,680 --> 00:12:26,120
He was awfully suspicious earlier today.

156
00:12:26,200 --> 00:12:28,440
I was just being safe. Let's do it.

157
00:12:59,360 --> 00:13:02,040
Don't worry, My Lady. Guanzhu told me

158
00:13:02,120 --> 00:13:04,560
a maid once quarreled
with the housekeeper.

159
00:13:04,640 --> 00:13:06,640
In a fit of anger,
she threw herself into the well.

160
00:13:06,720 --> 00:13:08,440
Servants have been forbidden
from coming here ever since.

161
00:13:09,560 --> 00:13:11,160
Governess Wu was determined to harm me,

162
00:13:11,840 --> 00:13:14,440
yet I have to cover
for her and the Wei family.

163
00:13:15,440 --> 00:13:18,640
Otherwise, once the truth comes out,
I'll be held responsible too.

164
00:13:19,680 --> 00:13:21,520
I was reckless
and caused all this trouble.

165
00:13:21,600 --> 00:13:23,680
I owe you my life, My Lady.

166
00:13:26,760 --> 00:13:28,640
She brought this on herself.

167
00:13:28,720 --> 00:13:29,720
You shouldn't have to die with her.

168
00:13:30,520 --> 00:13:31,840
Let's not speak of it again.

169
00:13:32,600 --> 00:13:35,320
What I asked you to do,
is everything taken care of?

170
00:13:44,480 --> 00:13:46,120
I only hope we can cover this up.

171
00:13:51,240 --> 00:13:55,240
DUKE'S RESIDENCE

172
00:13:59,640 --> 00:14:01,280
My Lord, it's time to wash and dress.

173
00:14:02,080 --> 00:14:03,240
I'll do it.

174
00:14:05,840 --> 00:14:06,800
My Lord.

175
00:14:16,160 --> 00:14:17,960
Let me help you wash, My Lord.

176
00:14:33,800 --> 00:14:34,960
Thank you.

177
00:15:03,880 --> 00:15:04,720
My Lord.

178
00:15:04,800 --> 00:15:06,920
The Dowager Lady and your mother
are here to see you.

179
00:15:15,960 --> 00:15:17,880
Grandmother. Mother.

180
00:15:21,560 --> 00:15:24,400
Zhuo. Are you feeling better today?

181
00:15:25,880 --> 00:15:28,320
Grandmother, my wounds have fully healed.

182
00:15:28,400 --> 00:15:29,440
Look.

183
00:15:32,120 --> 00:15:33,000
Actually…

184
00:15:40,480 --> 00:15:42,320
Grandmother, let me help you to your seat.

185
00:15:46,080 --> 00:15:47,360
I've always been strong.

186
00:15:47,880 --> 00:15:49,520
I've been in bed for over a month.

187
00:15:49,600 --> 00:15:50,960
I can't stand lying around any longer.

188
00:15:51,560 --> 00:15:54,000
Besides, at court
I still have urgent duties to attend to.

189
00:15:55,000 --> 00:15:57,680
Nothing, no matter how urgent,
is more important than your life.

190
00:15:57,760 --> 00:16:00,560
Unless Physician Zhao
personally vouches for you,

191
00:16:00,640 --> 00:16:04,360
none of your military colleagues,
not even that young General Qi,

192
00:16:04,440 --> 00:16:06,600
are allowed through this door.

193
00:16:07,680 --> 00:16:13,200
Zhuo, back then, your father
left his mother and all of us behind.

194
00:16:13,280 --> 00:16:16,680
If anything happens to you now,

195
00:16:17,200 --> 00:16:20,080
I'll have nothing left to live for.

196
00:16:20,960 --> 00:16:23,480
I might as well hang myself

197
00:16:24,000 --> 00:16:25,840
so I won't have to see it,

198
00:16:25,920 --> 00:16:30,640
rather than spend the rest of my days
drowning in grief.

199
00:16:32,640 --> 00:16:36,760
Fate brought you into our family
to live in constant fear.

200
00:16:36,840 --> 00:16:39,080
Such is the fate your mother and I share.

201
00:16:39,760 --> 00:16:41,760
But look at her.

202
00:16:41,840 --> 00:16:43,320
She's only been here a few days,

203
00:16:44,000 --> 00:16:46,520
yet she's been running herself
ragged for you.

204
00:16:46,600 --> 00:16:48,560
If you cared about her at all,

205
00:16:48,640 --> 00:16:52,080
you wouldn't say something so heartless.

206
00:16:55,400 --> 00:16:56,760
Dowager Lady.

207
00:16:57,480 --> 00:16:59,560
Governess Wu, who came here with the lady,

208
00:16:59,640 --> 00:17:01,440
has been missing since yesterday.

209
00:17:01,960 --> 00:17:03,800
We sent every servant
in the courtyard to look,

210
00:17:03,880 --> 00:17:04,880
but there's still no sign of her.

211
00:17:05,560 --> 00:17:09,680
I just searched her room and
found all her money and valuables gone.

212
00:17:12,960 --> 00:17:14,040
Grandmother.

213
00:17:15,160 --> 00:17:16,240
Before I married,

214
00:17:16,760 --> 00:17:19,000
my aunt feared I was too young
to manage a household,

215
00:17:19,880 --> 00:17:22,200
so she sent one of her most
trusted governess to come with me.

216
00:17:23,079 --> 00:17:27,040
I failed to keep her in line,
and this happened.

217
00:17:28,200 --> 00:17:29,280
- Dowager Lady.
- Bitao.

218
00:17:31,080 --> 00:17:32,040
Let her speak.

219
00:17:34,800 --> 00:17:36,280
My Lady, why cover for her?

220
00:17:36,960 --> 00:17:38,760
That woman knew she was sent by your elder

221
00:17:38,840 --> 00:17:40,560
and never showed you any respect.

222
00:17:41,160 --> 00:17:43,200
She drank, gambled,
and shirked her duties all day.

223
00:17:43,280 --> 00:17:44,800
She even stole
your lotus seed soup every day.

224
00:17:45,560 --> 00:17:47,400
When I caught her and scolded her,

225
00:17:47,480 --> 00:17:49,480
she got angry and threatened to go home.

226
00:17:49,560 --> 00:17:52,240
Yesterday was the servants' day off,

227
00:17:52,320 --> 00:17:54,000
so countless servants came
and went through the back gate.

228
00:17:54,080 --> 00:17:57,200
And the pass our courtyard uses
for errands just happened to go missing.

229
00:17:57,280 --> 00:17:58,640
- Maybe she slipped out in the chaos…
- Bitao.

230
00:17:58,720 --> 00:18:01,080
Governess Wu would
never break the rules like that.

231
00:18:01,160 --> 00:18:02,440
Don't make baseless accusations.

232
00:18:03,560 --> 00:18:04,920
How could this be your fault?

233
00:18:05,520 --> 00:18:07,440
Old servants in great households

234
00:18:07,520 --> 00:18:11,000
bully those below them
and flatter those above.

235
00:18:11,080 --> 00:18:14,680
If you're too strict with them,
they'll resent you.

236
00:18:14,760 --> 00:18:16,120
But if you're too lenient,

237
00:18:17,000 --> 00:18:20,480
they'll only take advantage of you more.

238
00:18:22,360 --> 00:18:24,040
If she's gone, let her go.

239
00:18:24,120 --> 00:18:25,920
Tomorrow, have Governess Miao

240
00:18:26,000 --> 00:18:29,080
pick a few truly capable servants for you.

241
00:18:30,320 --> 00:18:31,560
Thank you, Grandmother.

242
00:18:32,520 --> 00:18:35,600
Come to think of it,
this is really my fault.

243
00:18:36,200 --> 00:18:37,560
When His Lordship woke,

244
00:18:37,640 --> 00:18:40,760
Governess Wu asked twice to return
to the Wei Residence with the good news.

245
00:18:40,840 --> 00:18:43,120
But I refused her both times.

246
00:18:43,200 --> 00:18:45,840
Had I asked the Dowager Lady sooner
and received permission for her to leave,

247
00:18:45,920 --> 00:18:49,240
perhaps My Lady could've
been spared all this distress.

248
00:18:51,040 --> 00:18:52,360
So that's what happened.

249
00:18:53,880 --> 00:18:54,760
Grandmother.

250
00:18:55,880 --> 00:18:57,400
It's tradition for newlyweds
to visit her family on the third day.

251
00:18:58,520 --> 00:18:59,800
My illness delayed
that visit again and again.

252
00:19:00,440 --> 00:19:02,400
Ever since my wife married
into this family,

253
00:19:02,480 --> 00:19:03,560
she's barely rested while caring for me.

254
00:19:04,560 --> 00:19:06,000
That's why I've finally recovered.

255
00:19:06,600 --> 00:19:08,240
Now that I'm well,

256
00:19:08,320 --> 00:19:09,560
I should take my wife

257
00:19:09,640 --> 00:19:11,360
to the Earl of Cheng'an's Residence
to pay our respects.

258
00:19:11,880 --> 00:19:13,120
It's only proper as their grandson-in-law.

259
00:19:14,800 --> 00:19:16,200
I've long heard

260
00:19:16,880 --> 00:19:19,840
my wife was raised
by Old Madam Wei herself.

261
00:19:20,440 --> 00:19:21,440
They're very close,

262
00:19:22,240 --> 00:19:23,320
and deeply attached to each other.

263
00:19:24,480 --> 00:19:26,520
Rao is a devoted granddaughter.

264
00:19:27,120 --> 00:19:28,320
She's been away from home so long.

265
00:19:28,840 --> 00:19:32,680
She must miss her grandmother
and be eager to visit her family.

266
00:19:32,760 --> 00:19:33,600
I…

267
00:19:45,720 --> 00:19:46,840
As my lord wishes.

268
00:19:50,040 --> 00:19:54,000
I can tell you're just
looking for any way to get out.

269
00:19:54,760 --> 00:19:55,840
All right, then.

270
00:19:55,920 --> 00:19:58,480
You'll visit the Wei family in seven days.

271
00:19:59,440 --> 00:20:02,360
Send word to the Wei Residence.

272
00:20:02,440 --> 00:20:06,440
Zhuo, though I've allowed you to go out,

273
00:20:06,520 --> 00:20:08,680
don't overdo it.

274
00:20:08,760 --> 00:20:10,320
Your health comes first.

275
00:20:11,640 --> 00:20:12,640
Yes, Grandmother.

276
00:20:29,400 --> 00:20:33,440
Grandmother, you've been so worried lately
that you've lost quite a bit of weight.

277
00:20:33,520 --> 00:20:36,760
I've been terribly worried about you,
so I made these pastries myself

278
00:20:37,360 --> 00:20:38,280
and added some honey.

279
00:20:38,360 --> 00:20:40,160
The crust is nice and crisp. Try one.

280
00:20:52,640 --> 00:20:54,880
You're very thoughtful.

281
00:20:56,000 --> 00:20:59,920
But we haven't heard from Rao in days.

282
00:21:00,560 --> 00:21:04,480
I don't even know
how her husband, Lord Lu, is doing.

283
00:21:05,000 --> 00:21:08,480
How can I not worry?

284
00:21:09,000 --> 00:21:11,480
Mother, don't worry.

285
00:21:12,120 --> 00:21:14,400
Lord Lu may be gravely ill,

286
00:21:14,480 --> 00:21:18,360
but our Rao has always
been blessed with good fortune.

287
00:21:18,440 --> 00:21:22,920
Remember how that lost pearl
found its way back to us?

288
00:21:23,000 --> 00:21:24,640
No matter how grave his illness,

289
00:21:24,720 --> 00:21:26,880
Rao's marriage
was meant to ward off his bad luck.

290
00:21:26,960 --> 00:21:28,800
Surely he'll recover.

291
00:21:28,880 --> 00:21:32,680
The Lu family hasn't sent any news,

292
00:21:32,760 --> 00:21:35,600
but that may actually be a good sign.

293
00:21:35,680 --> 00:21:38,840
Yufeng, stop trying to comfort Mother.

294
00:21:38,920 --> 00:21:41,960
Every physician said he's beyond saving.

295
00:21:42,560 --> 00:21:46,080
They said he wouldn't make it
past the end of the month.

296
00:21:46,160 --> 00:21:50,200
When I woke up this morning,
my eyelid wouldn't stop twitching.

297
00:21:50,800 --> 00:21:54,720
I suspect the bad news
will come within a day or two.

298
00:21:54,800 --> 00:21:57,000
We should all prepare ourselves.

299
00:21:57,760 --> 00:21:59,080
Silence!

300
00:21:59,160 --> 00:22:01,320
If your cursed tongue proves right

301
00:22:02,000 --> 00:22:03,800
and my Rao truly becomes a widow,

302
00:22:03,880 --> 00:22:06,400
I'll make you pay with your life!

303
00:22:08,760 --> 00:22:12,320
Dowager Lady! Wonderful news! Great news!

304
00:22:13,920 --> 00:22:16,680
Congratulations, Dowager Lady!
The Lu family sent word.

305
00:22:16,760 --> 00:22:18,520
Lord Lu has finally recovered.

306
00:22:18,600 --> 00:22:22,400
He'll soon bring the Lady Rao
back home for a visit.

307
00:22:23,000 --> 00:22:24,400
- Really?
- It's true.

308
00:22:25,080 --> 00:22:25,920
What did you say?

309
00:22:26,000 --> 00:22:27,600
- Say that again!
- Wonderful! Wonderful!

310
00:22:27,680 --> 00:22:28,640
He survived! He survived!

311
00:22:29,240 --> 00:22:31,880
Heaven spared Lord Lu
and brought him back from the brink.

312
00:22:31,960 --> 00:22:33,280
He's alive!

313
00:22:35,720 --> 00:22:38,520
Good! Good! Wonderful!

314
00:22:40,040 --> 00:22:41,280
Congratulations, Mother.

315
00:22:41,360 --> 00:22:43,560
Why am I suddenly hungry?

316
00:22:44,160 --> 00:22:45,160
Die!

317
00:22:45,240 --> 00:22:46,320
Lady Rao…

318
00:22:46,400 --> 00:22:47,840
You should all die!

319
00:22:48,400 --> 00:22:50,960
- Why won't you die? You should all die!
- Lady Rao…

320
00:22:52,160 --> 00:22:53,400
All of you should die!

321
00:22:53,480 --> 00:22:54,840
THE JADE BOUGH FALLS

322
00:22:54,920 --> 00:22:56,720
Every last one of you should die!

323
00:22:56,800 --> 00:22:59,000
Just die! All of you!

324
00:23:00,640 --> 00:23:01,560
Rao.

325
00:23:04,320 --> 00:23:05,600
Are you all right?

326
00:23:05,680 --> 00:23:06,520
Did you hurt yourself?

327
00:23:07,640 --> 00:23:08,680
Good heavens!

328
00:23:10,520 --> 00:23:11,520
All of you, leave us.

329
00:23:14,560 --> 00:23:15,440
Yes.

330
00:23:18,680 --> 00:23:19,880
Look at your hand.

331
00:23:19,960 --> 00:23:21,280
Even if you're angry with a servant,

332
00:23:21,360 --> 00:23:23,320
you can't hurt yourself like this.

333
00:23:23,400 --> 00:23:24,400
Aunt.

334
00:23:25,000 --> 00:23:26,440
Lu Zhuo isn't dead.

335
00:23:27,080 --> 00:23:28,720
He actually survived.

336
00:23:30,240 --> 00:23:31,920
Why didn't he die?

337
00:23:32,440 --> 00:23:34,120
He was supposed to die!

338
00:23:35,080 --> 00:23:38,160
He should've rotted away in the filth,
his flesh and bones decaying!

339
00:23:39,880 --> 00:23:41,240
If he lives,

340
00:23:41,320 --> 00:23:43,520
then haven't I outsmarted myself

341
00:23:44,120 --> 00:23:47,840
and handed all the wealth and honor
of being his wife to someone else?

342
00:23:49,720 --> 00:23:51,680
A lowly woman,

343
00:23:53,720 --> 00:23:56,360
someone who emptied chamber pots
from house to house,

344
00:23:56,960 --> 00:23:59,320
has suddenly transformed

345
00:24:00,120 --> 00:24:04,000
into the rightful wife of Lord Lu.

346
00:24:07,160 --> 00:24:08,280
What a joke.

347
00:24:10,280 --> 00:24:13,280
Why? Why!

348
00:24:13,360 --> 00:24:14,760
Rao, calm down!

349
00:24:16,000 --> 00:24:17,520
I know how wronged you feel.

350
00:24:17,600 --> 00:24:19,640
This is all Lu Zhuo's fault.

351
00:24:20,160 --> 00:24:22,720
He was supposed to die, but didn't,
and that's what caused this whole mess.

352
00:24:22,800 --> 00:24:25,480
I'll go to the Lu family
right now and show them

353
00:24:25,560 --> 00:24:27,240
who the Wei family's true jewel is,

354
00:24:27,320 --> 00:24:28,680
and who should be Lord Lu's wife!

355
00:24:28,760 --> 00:24:30,280
You absolutely can't!

356
00:24:30,360 --> 00:24:31,640
Think about it.

357
00:24:32,320 --> 00:24:34,160
When Lu Zhuo
was gravely ill and near death,

358
00:24:34,240 --> 00:24:35,600
the Lu family even reported it
to the Empress Dowager.

359
00:24:36,200 --> 00:24:39,000
They welcomed the bride
into the family with great ceremony.

360
00:24:39,080 --> 00:24:41,360
Everyone believes
the wedding cured a dying man,

361
00:24:41,440 --> 00:24:42,920
and praises her as a woman
blessed with good fortune.

362
00:24:43,600 --> 00:24:45,960
If you go to the Lu family now,

363
00:24:46,040 --> 00:24:49,200
they'll learn that our Wei family
switched the brides

364
00:24:49,800 --> 00:24:51,640
and dared marry
a lowborn girl to their heir.

365
00:24:51,720 --> 00:24:53,160
Of course they'd be furious.

366
00:24:53,760 --> 00:24:57,280
Our families would become bitter enemies,
and the marriage still couldn't be undone.

367
00:24:57,880 --> 00:24:58,720
Even…

368
00:24:59,600 --> 00:25:01,400
Even if your grandmother
learned the truth,

369
00:25:01,480 --> 00:25:02,880
I'm afraid she wouldn't
forgive you either.

370
00:25:09,520 --> 00:25:13,560
Aunt, are you saying
I should just swallow this humiliation

371
00:25:14,360 --> 00:25:16,920
and let someone else
take my name and husband?

372
00:25:18,520 --> 00:25:22,000
Am I to hide at this hot spring
estate forever, living as a shadow?

373
00:25:22,680 --> 00:25:24,000
I'd rather die!

374
00:25:24,080 --> 00:25:25,280
Rao!

375
00:25:26,400 --> 00:25:27,520
Calm down.

376
00:25:28,160 --> 00:25:30,040
I've already thought everything through.

377
00:25:30,640 --> 00:25:33,400
Pack your things at once.

378
00:25:33,480 --> 00:25:34,440
Come back to the residence
with me in secret.

379
00:25:35,680 --> 00:25:37,160
When she returns to visit her family,

380
00:25:37,240 --> 00:25:39,280
I'll have everything arranged.

381
00:25:41,600 --> 00:25:42,640
You mean…

382
00:25:42,720 --> 00:25:45,160
When that wretched maid comes back,

383
00:25:45,240 --> 00:25:48,360
I'll set everything right
and undo this whole mess.

384
00:25:48,440 --> 00:25:50,920
You'll take your rightful place
as Lord Lu's wife.

385
00:25:54,520 --> 00:25:55,640
I knew it.

386
00:25:57,360 --> 00:25:59,200
You're always the best to me, Aunt.

387
00:25:59,280 --> 00:26:01,440
I know how much you've suffered.

388
00:26:02,920 --> 00:26:05,960
Later, I'll personally help you get ready.

389
00:26:17,040 --> 00:26:17,920
DUKE'S RESIDENCE

390
00:26:18,000 --> 00:26:21,520
Your wife went to
see the Dowager Lady early this morning.

391
00:26:21,600 --> 00:26:24,600
I suppose she kept her a little longer
with some last-minute advice.

392
00:26:25,200 --> 00:26:27,040
So don't look upset when she arrives.

393
00:26:27,120 --> 00:26:29,480
Mother, I won't.

394
00:26:31,040 --> 00:26:32,400
My Lord, you've only just recovered.

395
00:26:32,480 --> 00:26:33,680
You really shouldn't be going out yet.

396
00:26:33,760 --> 00:26:36,440
While you're out,
you mustn't get chilled or catch a draft.

397
00:26:36,520 --> 00:26:38,680
And you shouldn't drink at the banquet.

398
00:26:38,760 --> 00:26:41,600
Alcohol will stir up your blood
and could seriously harm your health.

399
00:26:42,200 --> 00:26:43,440
Enough.

400
00:26:47,720 --> 00:26:49,720
WANXIANG HALL

401
00:27:04,680 --> 00:27:07,800
DUKE'S RESIDENCE

402
00:27:07,880 --> 00:27:09,400
The Dowager Lady kept me for a while.

403
00:27:09,480 --> 00:27:11,520
Sorry to keep you waiting,
Mother, My Lord.

404
00:27:12,640 --> 00:27:13,520
Rao.

405
00:27:13,600 --> 00:27:16,040
You dressed so plainly
while Lu Zhuo was ill.

406
00:27:16,120 --> 00:27:19,040
Today you look
especially bright and festive.

407
00:27:19,120 --> 00:27:21,400
It's such a joy to see.

408
00:27:22,440 --> 00:27:23,800
No need to delay.

409
00:27:24,800 --> 00:27:25,640
Let's go.

410
00:27:31,960 --> 00:27:34,040
Zhuo, you've only just recovered
from a serious illness.

411
00:27:34,120 --> 00:27:35,520
You're still weak and short of strength.

412
00:27:36,120 --> 00:27:38,080
Don't ride today.

413
00:27:39,320 --> 00:27:41,320
Ride in the carriage with your wife.

414
00:27:43,560 --> 00:27:44,600
No need.

415
00:27:48,640 --> 00:27:50,000
My heart…

416
00:27:53,280 --> 00:27:54,720
Mother has a point.

417
00:27:55,560 --> 00:27:56,880
I'll do as you say.

418
00:27:58,240 --> 00:28:01,480
Go on. Come back early.

419
00:28:24,240 --> 00:28:25,480
Thank you, My Lord.

420
00:28:42,600 --> 00:28:43,840
No need to see us off, Mother.

421
00:28:43,920 --> 00:28:45,200
Please go back inside.

422
00:29:59,600 --> 00:30:02,440
<i>Her hands are covered</i>
<i>in calluses and scars.</i>

423
00:30:02,520 --> 00:30:04,400
<i>No wonder she always wears gloves.</i>

424
00:30:10,200 --> 00:30:12,800
My Lord, Jewelers' Lane is just ahead.

425
00:30:13,880 --> 00:30:16,080
You've cared for me so well
and stayed by my side.

426
00:30:16,600 --> 00:30:17,600
I'd like to buy you some jewelry.

427
00:30:18,600 --> 00:30:19,760
I couldn't go out before.

428
00:30:20,360 --> 00:30:21,600
Today, you can pick whatever you like.

429
00:30:29,480 --> 00:30:33,120
My Lord, forgive me
for not welcoming you sooner.

430
00:30:33,200 --> 00:30:35,080
My Lord, please come inside for some tea.

431
00:31:17,440 --> 00:31:18,520
Here.

432
00:31:18,600 --> 00:31:20,560
- I can't accept this.
- Put it on.

433
00:31:22,800 --> 00:31:24,800
A fortune-teller said
I lack water in my five elements.

434
00:31:24,880 --> 00:31:27,400
Gold creates water,
so I should wear more gold.

435
00:31:28,280 --> 00:31:30,360
I never cared
for such gaudy things before.

436
00:31:31,040 --> 00:31:32,920
But now I want to share
my good fortune with His Lordship.

437
00:31:33,000 --> 00:31:35,400
So I'll have to wear
much more from now on.

438
00:31:36,000 --> 00:31:38,680
Bitao, you serve me every day.

439
00:31:39,480 --> 00:31:42,000
Wearing gold can bring me luck too.

440
00:31:43,320 --> 00:31:45,600
You hear that?
Bring out your finest pieces for My Lady.

441
00:31:45,680 --> 00:31:48,280
Yes. My Lady may
choose anything she likes.

442
00:31:48,360 --> 00:31:50,760
The heavier the gold,
the greater the blessing.

443
00:31:50,840 --> 00:31:53,760
For His Lordship's health,
I suppose I'll have to bear the burden.

444
00:31:57,520 --> 00:31:58,280
Let's talk business.

445
00:32:01,760 --> 00:32:04,160
All right, all right. Business.

446
00:32:08,760 --> 00:32:11,120
Lady Wei Rao is quite amusing.

447
00:32:11,200 --> 00:32:13,680
I've been watching her manner,
her speech and bearing.

448
00:32:13,760 --> 00:32:15,080
There's none of the shrewish temper
we heard about.

449
00:32:15,160 --> 00:32:16,280
She's like a different person.

450
00:32:18,400 --> 00:32:20,120
Why not invite my new sister-in-law in?

451
00:32:20,200 --> 00:32:21,120
I'd like to meet her.

452
00:32:23,920 --> 00:32:24,760
Business first.

453
00:32:29,960 --> 00:32:32,920
That day, only after we beheaded
Xiahou Xian, Hutuo's Left Wudu Marquis,

454
00:32:33,440 --> 00:32:34,680
did our army narrowly win.

455
00:32:35,280 --> 00:32:38,600
But on the night of my surprise attack,
how was the plan leaked?

456
00:32:40,560 --> 00:32:41,440
Did you find out?

457
00:32:42,040 --> 00:32:43,440
You suspect…

458
00:32:45,040 --> 00:32:46,520
No. That's impossible.

459
00:32:46,600 --> 00:32:48,360
Besides us,

460
00:32:48,440 --> 00:32:50,200
only a handful in the army
knew about the surprise attack.

461
00:32:51,000 --> 00:32:52,760
They were either supervisors
trusted by His Majesty

462
00:32:52,840 --> 00:32:54,680
or battle-hardened generals.

463
00:32:55,280 --> 00:32:59,240
You think they secretly colluded with
Hutuo and leaked vital intelligence?

464
00:32:59,320 --> 00:33:00,520
How could that be possible?

465
00:33:01,080 --> 00:33:03,520
Lu Zhuo, you're being far too suspicious.

466
00:33:04,120 --> 00:33:08,000
Am I really too suspicious,
or is someone secretly aiding the enemy?

467
00:33:10,160 --> 00:33:12,520
- There's only one way to find out.
- How?

468
00:33:16,320 --> 00:33:18,560
I'm making a grand visit
to my wife's family today.

469
00:33:18,640 --> 00:33:21,480
Soon all of the capital
will know I'm still alive.

470
00:33:22,760 --> 00:33:24,240
Just spread the rumor

471
00:33:25,200 --> 00:33:28,960
that I seized a secret letter
from the enemy camp.

472
00:33:46,880 --> 00:33:50,920
To pray for your good health, My Lord,
I had no choice.

473
00:33:51,520 --> 00:33:52,360
How gaudy.

474
00:34:01,040 --> 00:34:02,080
You…

475
00:34:04,320 --> 00:34:05,440
What are you doing?

476
00:34:06,560 --> 00:34:08,440
I picked all of these with great care.

477
00:34:10,199 --> 00:34:11,639
These would look beautiful in my hair.

478
00:34:12,960 --> 00:34:14,639
We'll keep this one.

479
00:34:33,280 --> 00:34:34,679
Excellent choice, My Lord.

480
00:34:34,760 --> 00:34:36,600
This gold hairpin is exquisitely crafted.

481
00:34:37,360 --> 00:34:38,800
It's extremely rare.

482
00:34:38,880 --> 00:34:41,199
You won't find another like it
in the city.

483
00:34:41,280 --> 00:34:43,920
<i>I was hoping to keep some</i>
<i>for myself for the future.</i>

484
00:34:44,440 --> 00:34:45,600
<i>Now all my planning was for nothing.</i>

485
00:34:46,120 --> 00:34:47,040
So stingy.

486
00:34:51,000 --> 00:34:53,400
Send everything else
to the Duke's Residence.

487
00:34:55,080 --> 00:34:56,159
Yes. Yes.

488
00:34:56,239 --> 00:34:57,080
Why aren't you leaving?

489
00:35:03,960 --> 00:35:04,920
My Lady.

490
00:35:09,720 --> 00:35:11,680
Farewell, My Lord.

491
00:35:22,960 --> 00:35:25,920
Don't we still have
that gold necklace set with sapphires?

492
00:35:26,560 --> 00:35:27,720
Send that to her too.

493
00:35:28,640 --> 00:35:30,000
Yes, yes.

494
00:35:30,080 --> 00:35:31,560
It's so heavy.

495
00:35:31,640 --> 00:35:34,000
I hope it doesn't snap her slender neck.

496
00:35:34,640 --> 00:35:40,440
EARL OF CHENG'AN'S RESIDENCE

497
00:35:45,760 --> 00:35:47,040
You're home. That's what matters.

498
00:35:49,240 --> 00:35:50,920
That's all that matters.

499
00:35:59,240 --> 00:36:01,240
My Rao is home.

500
00:36:02,560 --> 00:36:04,120
I'm so glad you're back.

501
00:36:06,280 --> 00:36:09,480
Ever since you married,
your grandmother has missed you every day.

502
00:36:09,560 --> 00:36:10,480
LOTUS ROOM

503
00:36:10,560 --> 00:36:12,280
She often cries when no one's looking.

504
00:36:12,880 --> 00:36:15,800
Her eyesight has worsened lately too.

505
00:36:16,400 --> 00:36:18,040
She's taking medicine for it.

506
00:36:18,880 --> 00:36:19,760
I've been a poor granddaughter.

507
00:36:19,840 --> 00:36:20,720
I made you worry.

508
00:36:20,800 --> 00:36:24,680
Rao, get up. Please, get up.

509
00:36:26,000 --> 00:36:28,160
- Mother.
- Rao…

510
00:36:28,240 --> 00:36:29,920
Let me help you sit down first.

511
00:36:30,000 --> 00:36:31,560
Don't be sad.

512
00:36:32,840 --> 00:36:34,040
Here. Easy now.

513
00:36:44,200 --> 00:36:45,560
Mother.

514
00:36:45,640 --> 00:36:48,960
On such a happy day,
and with honored guests here,

515
00:36:49,720 --> 00:36:52,080
you really shouldn't cry.

516
00:36:53,240 --> 00:36:54,120
We're all family.

517
00:36:54,200 --> 00:36:56,000
There's no need to be so formal.

518
00:36:57,320 --> 00:36:58,160
From now on,

519
00:36:58,240 --> 00:37:00,080
I'll bring my wife back often
to visit you.

520
00:37:01,080 --> 00:37:03,280
I hope you won't mind
having us around so much.

521
00:37:03,920 --> 00:37:06,640
I'd be happier if you stayed a few days.

522
00:37:07,960 --> 00:37:10,720
Begonia Court is always ready for you.

523
00:37:11,320 --> 00:37:14,680
Everything inside
has been left just as it was.

524
00:37:14,760 --> 00:37:18,000
It's carefully cleaned every day.

525
00:37:27,760 --> 00:37:29,840
ORCHID ROOM

526
00:37:41,440 --> 00:37:42,400
Dowager Lady.

527
00:37:42,480 --> 00:37:44,800
Lord Lu is invited to the front hall.

528
00:37:44,880 --> 00:37:46,120
All the guests have arrived.

529
00:37:51,200 --> 00:37:53,760
Lord Lu, are you feeling unwell?

530
00:37:55,000 --> 00:37:55,840
I felt fine when we left.

531
00:37:56,440 --> 00:37:58,440
But I went to Jewelers' Lane
with Rao earlier.

532
00:38:00,120 --> 00:38:01,520
Perhaps I overexerted myself.

533
00:38:02,040 --> 00:38:03,040
I'm sure it's nothing serious.

534
00:38:04,760 --> 00:38:07,360
Rao, come here. Come.

535
00:38:09,480 --> 00:38:10,320
Come.

536
00:38:12,840 --> 00:38:15,360
He's only just recovered
from a serious illness.

537
00:38:15,440 --> 00:38:18,440
You shouldn't have made him
come all this way.

538
00:38:18,520 --> 00:38:22,280
All this traveling
must have exhausted him.

539
00:38:22,360 --> 00:38:25,320
Someone recovering from a long illness
shouldn't talk too much.

540
00:38:26,000 --> 00:38:27,280
It drains his strength.

541
00:38:27,880 --> 00:38:32,080
And I'm afraid some thoughtless guests
may even pressure him to drink.

542
00:38:33,200 --> 00:38:35,840
Skip the banquet.

543
00:38:36,440 --> 00:38:39,360
Rest in Rao's room instead.

544
00:38:40,040 --> 00:38:41,040
That way,

545
00:38:41,120 --> 00:38:44,160
I can spend more time
talking with her too.

546
00:38:44,240 --> 00:38:46,160
I am feeling a little tired.

547
00:38:47,200 --> 00:38:48,800
Thank you for your consideration,
Old Madam Wei.

548
00:38:49,520 --> 00:38:52,640
Good, good. Take Lord Lu to Rao's room.

549
00:38:53,240 --> 00:38:56,400
Make sure he's well looked after.

550
00:39:03,040 --> 00:39:04,200
Grandmother.

551
00:39:04,280 --> 00:39:05,560
Have some tea.

552
00:39:10,200 --> 00:39:11,360
I was careless.

553
00:39:11,440 --> 00:39:12,920
- It's fine.
- Why are you so careless?

554
00:39:13,000 --> 00:39:13,840
Always so clumsy.

555
00:39:17,160 --> 00:39:19,280
Quick, let me see. Did you burn yourself?

556
00:39:19,880 --> 00:39:22,400
No, I'm fine.

557
00:39:23,600 --> 00:39:26,640
Rao, being the wife
of the family heir isn't easy.

558
00:39:26,720 --> 00:39:29,800
You must carry yourself
with more dignity from now on.

559
00:39:29,880 --> 00:39:33,480
Come. Let's go inside
and get you cleaned up.

560
00:39:34,960 --> 00:39:38,200
Mother, why don't I go with you?

561
00:39:39,120 --> 00:39:42,320
I want some private time with Rao.

562
00:39:42,400 --> 00:39:44,080
Do you have to come in and bother us too?

563
00:39:45,280 --> 00:39:46,640
Go away. Come.

564
00:39:48,680 --> 00:39:49,520
Rao.

565
00:39:51,640 --> 00:39:53,080
Take good care of Grandmother.

566
00:39:54,840 --> 00:39:55,840
Yes.

567
00:39:55,920 --> 00:39:57,880
Rao, come on.

568
00:40:05,280 --> 00:40:07,840
She comes from
such a humble family after all.

569
00:40:08,640 --> 00:40:11,520
Look how timid she is.

570
00:40:12,040 --> 00:40:14,440
She'd never dare stand against you.

571
00:40:14,520 --> 00:40:16,120
But you…

572
00:40:17,520 --> 00:40:21,320
If you lose your composure,
you'll only give yourself away.

573
00:40:22,160 --> 00:40:24,160
No need to say more, Yufeng.

574
00:40:24,240 --> 00:40:25,920
I know what I'm doing.

575
00:40:28,240 --> 00:40:32,160
ORCHID ROOM

576
00:40:36,440 --> 00:40:38,360
This is Lady Rao's room.

577
00:40:45,000 --> 00:40:46,560
I'd like to rest alone for a while.

578
00:40:47,640 --> 00:40:48,840
You may all leave.

579
00:41:11,320 --> 00:41:12,440
<i>That scent…</i>

580
00:41:20,920 --> 00:41:22,160
You may all leave.

581
00:41:35,000 --> 00:41:37,600
Grandmother, is there something
you want to tell me?

582
00:41:45,480 --> 00:41:46,520
Open it and see.

583
00:41:49,840 --> 00:41:52,680
These are the farmlands and deeds

584
00:41:52,760 --> 00:41:57,080
your father left you years ago.

585
00:41:57,160 --> 00:42:00,680
And over a dozen shops
on the streets near Anshang Gate

586
00:42:00,760 --> 00:42:02,640
and Hanguang Gate.

587
00:42:02,720 --> 00:42:03,560
And there's more.

588
00:42:03,640 --> 00:42:07,480
Over the years,
I've saved some private money for you.

589
00:42:08,680 --> 00:42:10,320
Keep it all safe.

590
00:42:15,960 --> 00:42:17,200
I already have my dowry.

591
00:42:17,280 --> 00:42:19,840
Please keep these for yourself.

592
00:42:19,920 --> 00:42:23,920
Silly child, everyone knows
what's in your dowry.

593
00:42:24,000 --> 00:42:26,480
You can't use it freely.

594
00:42:27,720 --> 00:42:31,400
Your mother-in-law
rarely manages the household.

595
00:42:31,480 --> 00:42:34,240
The second branch
runs the Duke's Residence,

596
00:42:34,320 --> 00:42:37,520
so they'll inevitably
have some control over you.

597
00:42:38,120 --> 00:42:39,440
With these,

598
00:42:40,080 --> 00:42:42,160
you can live your own life

599
00:42:42,240 --> 00:42:45,440
without depending
on your husband for everything,

600
00:42:45,520 --> 00:42:49,200
or asking the household for every expense.

601
00:42:49,880 --> 00:42:53,240
You can spend it however you like.

602
00:42:53,320 --> 00:42:56,000
You'll have much more freedom.

603
00:42:56,520 --> 00:42:57,680
Rao,

604
00:42:59,120 --> 00:43:01,720
I forced you into this marriage.

605
00:43:02,240 --> 00:43:04,400
I truly wronged you.

606
00:43:05,400 --> 00:43:08,920
And I've wronged my son who died so young.

607
00:43:09,520 --> 00:43:10,960
You are

608
00:43:11,480 --> 00:43:16,600
the only child he left in this world.

609
00:43:22,920 --> 00:43:25,000
Lady Rao, the floor is cold.

610
00:43:25,600 --> 00:43:29,680
Rao, get up. Please, get up.

611
00:43:29,760 --> 00:43:31,280
The floor is cold.

612
00:43:49,560 --> 00:43:50,400
You…

613
00:44:08,760 --> 00:44:09,760
Mother.

614
00:44:16,360 --> 00:44:19,400
LOTUS ROOM

615
00:44:19,480 --> 00:44:24,240
Mother, what secret did you
and your granddaughter have to discuss

616
00:44:24,320 --> 00:44:25,840
that you had to keep from both of us?

617
00:44:25,920 --> 00:44:30,480
I remembered your brother
once gave me a jade pendant.

618
00:44:30,560 --> 00:44:33,280
It was just sitting in storage,
unused all these years.

619
00:44:33,960 --> 00:44:39,320
So I gave it to Wei Rao
as something to remember him by.

620
00:44:39,400 --> 00:44:40,840
Are you jealous even of that?

621
00:44:42,200 --> 00:44:44,240
And you're supposed to be her elder.

622
00:44:45,960 --> 00:44:47,960
Rao, look.

623
00:44:48,520 --> 00:44:51,680
Your grandmother really does adore you.

624
00:44:58,720 --> 00:45:00,040
Rao.

625
00:45:00,120 --> 00:45:02,480
Your cousin has deeply regretted

626
00:45:02,560 --> 00:45:05,080
always bickering with you
before you married.

627
00:45:05,680 --> 00:45:07,680
She often says that without you,

628
00:45:07,760 --> 00:45:10,040
the house feels much quieter.

629
00:45:10,120 --> 00:45:11,360
When she heard you were coming home,

630
00:45:11,960 --> 00:45:15,400
she personally prepared
a gift for you and your husband.

631
00:45:17,120 --> 00:45:19,320
She strung these pearls herself.

632
00:45:19,400 --> 00:45:23,040
They aren't worth much,
but they're a token of sisterly affection.

633
00:45:23,560 --> 00:45:27,520
Sadly, she caught a cold
these past few days

634
00:45:27,600 --> 00:45:29,160
and can't give it to you herself.

635
00:45:29,240 --> 00:45:31,160
She's terribly upset about it.

636
00:45:32,320 --> 00:45:33,400
Thank you, Aunt.

637
00:45:33,480 --> 00:45:37,080
You two cousins
have bickered since you were little.

638
00:45:37,160 --> 00:45:38,440
You've only been apart a few days,

639
00:45:38,520 --> 00:45:40,680
and that stubborn girl
has already softened.

640
00:45:41,640 --> 00:45:44,120
Chan has always been proud.

641
00:45:44,200 --> 00:45:46,440
It's rare for her to make the first move.

642
00:45:46,960 --> 00:45:49,880
You really should
go visit her at Orchid Court.

643
00:45:50,560 --> 00:45:54,000
It'll show there's no bad blood
between you.

644
00:46:09,880 --> 00:46:11,280
Grandmother.

645
00:46:11,360 --> 00:46:13,160
Seeing you cousins get along

646
00:46:14,520 --> 00:46:18,120
puts my mind at ease. Go on.

647
00:46:20,480 --> 00:46:23,160
Then I'll come back and keep you company.

648
00:46:50,120 --> 00:46:51,560
Greetings, Lady Rao.

649
00:46:52,080 --> 00:46:54,080
Bitao, Chunyan sent word

650
00:46:54,160 --> 00:46:56,000
that Lord Lu finds
the porcelain pillow too hard

651
00:46:56,080 --> 00:46:57,280
and the jade pillow too cold.

652
00:46:57,360 --> 00:46:59,040
My Lady had a pearl-filled silk pillow.

653
00:46:59,120 --> 00:47:00,640
Chunyan searched everywhere
but couldn't find it.

654
00:47:00,720 --> 00:47:02,080
You used to keep all those things,

655
00:47:02,160 --> 00:47:03,960
so she asked if Bitao could help her look.

656
00:47:04,920 --> 00:47:07,640
Go take a look. Come back quickly.

657
00:47:09,560 --> 00:47:10,600
Yes.

658
00:47:20,480 --> 00:47:23,680
My Lady. Lady Chan was thrilled
to hear you were coming.

659
00:47:23,760 --> 00:47:25,160
She sent me here especially to meet you.

660
00:47:26,880 --> 00:47:27,760
This way, please.

661
00:47:40,960 --> 00:47:44,320
A REFINED SPIRIT, A TRANQUIL MIND

662
00:47:54,240 --> 00:47:57,560
BOOK PAVILION

663
00:47:58,480 --> 00:48:01,080
Lady Chan is waiting inside. Please.

664
00:48:03,320 --> 00:48:04,800
Wasn't my third sister
waiting at Orchid Court?

665
00:48:05,560 --> 00:48:07,080
Why is she here instead?

666
00:48:07,160 --> 00:48:08,800
Lady Chan has always loved books.

667
00:48:08,880 --> 00:48:10,440
Even when she's ill,
she never puts them down.

668
00:48:10,520 --> 00:48:12,080
Don't you remember, My Lady?

669
00:48:12,160 --> 00:48:13,720
You'll see her once you go inside.

670
00:48:21,560 --> 00:48:22,680
Why did you lock me in?

671
00:48:23,280 --> 00:48:26,600
Open the door! Open it! Open the door!

672
00:48:26,680 --> 00:48:28,120
Open this door!

673
00:48:29,160 --> 00:48:31,240
Open the door! Open it!

674
00:48:37,360 --> 00:48:40,640
Open the door! Let me out!

675
00:48:41,480 --> 00:48:42,600
Open the door!

676
00:48:42,680 --> 00:48:45,040
You fool.
All you had to do was tie her up.

677
00:48:45,120 --> 00:48:46,560
and quietly switch places with her.

678
00:48:46,640 --> 00:48:47,760
No one would've known.

679
00:48:48,440 --> 00:48:50,760
But you had to make a spectacle
and bring lamp oil.

680
00:48:51,360 --> 00:48:52,520
Are you trying
to draw everyone's attention?

681
00:48:52,600 --> 00:48:53,440
Open the door!

682
00:48:53,520 --> 00:48:54,920
Book Pavilion is secluded.

683
00:48:55,000 --> 00:48:56,720
- Somebody help!
- Fires often break out here.

684
00:48:57,360 --> 00:48:59,240
If a maid burned to death,
no one would think it strange.

685
00:49:00,360 --> 00:49:02,200
Aunt, you know me best.

686
00:49:02,280 --> 00:49:04,560
I've always been headstrong and ruthless.

687
00:49:04,640 --> 00:49:06,880
She's just a lowly woman
who emptied chamber pots.

688
00:49:06,960 --> 00:49:09,000
How dare she take what's mine?

689
00:49:09,880 --> 00:49:12,040
- Open the door!
- I want her dead without even a grave.

690
00:49:13,480 --> 00:49:14,320
Do it now.

691
00:49:15,520 --> 00:49:16,600
Give it to me.

692
00:49:27,160 --> 00:49:29,400
Open the door!

693
00:49:30,360 --> 00:49:32,400
Open the door!

694
00:49:40,680 --> 00:49:42,120
Help!

695
00:49:43,360 --> 00:49:44,760
Help!

696
00:49:44,840 --> 00:49:46,640
Help!

697
00:49:46,720 --> 00:49:48,880
Help!

698
00:49:50,400 --> 00:49:52,280
Somebody!

699
00:49:52,360 --> 00:49:55,320
Is anyone there? Help!

700
00:49:56,160 --> 00:49:58,160
Help!

701
00:52:11,760 --> 00:52:14,000
‪NO ANIMALS WERE HARMED
‪IN THE MAKING OF THIS SHOW
